<page xmlns="http://projectmallard.org/1.0/" type="topic" id="ui-transcript">
  <info>
    <link type="guide" xref="index"/>
    <desc>Use the accessible plain-text transcript.</desc>
  </info>
  <title>Transcript Area</title>
  <p>The accessible transcript is a read-only plain-text representation of the conversation. It supports keyboard selection and assistive technology access.</p>
  <p>The rendered conversation remains the primary display; use the transcript when plain text or accessibility support is needed.</p>
</page>
